  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Breaking the Climate-Conflict Cycle in Galmudug, Somalia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project addresses the climate-conflict nexus in Somalia and seeks to address and reverse the multiplier effect that climate change has on violent conflict in specific regions of the country and enhance the capacity of conflict- and displacement-affected communities to adapt to the negative effects of climate change.</narrative>
  </description>
